#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:5
msgid "Folio referencing properties"
msgstr "Folio 引用属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows creating schemas with multiple `folios`_, only part of "
"the `schema`_ is represented at each `folio`_. This means that part of a "
"`conductor`_ can be at one `folio`_ and the continuation at a different "
"`folio`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许创建多功能的策略 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 中，仅包含 `计划 <schema_>`_ 代表每个 `图幅 "
"<folio_>`_。这意味着： `导体 <conductor_>`_ 可能是一个 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 和以不同方式继续 `图幅 "
"<folio_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:11
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides folio referencing elements to indicate from where a "
"`conductor`_ is coming or where it is going. These `elements`_ can display "
"at the `workspace`_ from the `folio`_ some information about the folio "
"referencing element linked. The information which should be displayed can be"
" defined by the user at **Folio referencing** tab from **New Folio** section"
" of the `project properties`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 提供了folio 参考元素，以说明从何处 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 这些东西会飞到哪里 `元件 "
"<elements_>`_ 可以在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 从 `图幅 <folio_>`_ "
"关于链接的folio引用元素的一些信息。应当显示的信息可由用户定义。 **Folio 参考** 选项卡 **新组合** 报告 `项目属性 "
"<project properties_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:18
msgid ""
"For more information about folio referencing, refer to `Reference folio "
"following`_ and `Previous reference folio`_."
msgstr ""
"有关folio参考物的更多信息，请参见 `后面的参考物 <Reference folio following_>`_ 和 `之前的参考物 "
"<Previous reference folio_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:24
msgid "Figure: Project folio referencing properties window"
msgstr "图：Folio 项目属性引用窗口"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:26
msgid "To define folio referencing Label:"
msgstr "要定义标注符的缩写："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:28
msgid "`Display`_ project properties PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ 项目属性 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:29
msgid "Go to **New folio** section."
msgstr "转到 **新folio** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:30
msgid "Go to **Folio referencing** tab."
msgstr "转到 **Folio 引用** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:31
msgid "Define the desired parameters for each field."
msgstr "定义每个字段的理想参数。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio_referencing.rst:32
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close project "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改和关闭项目属性 PopUP 窗口。"
